---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---
<SiteLayout title="Terms of Use | ClearMark AI" description="Terms for using the ClearMark AI image cleanup service.">
  <header class="legal-page"><span class="eyebrow">Terms</span><h1>Use the tool for work you have the right to edit</h1></header>
  <article class="legal-body"><p>By using ClearMark AI, you confirm that you own the uploaded image or have permission to modify it. You must not use the service to misrepresent authorship, evade licensing, or infringe intellectual property rights.</p><h2>Service status</h2><p>This MVP uses demo processing and may return an unchanged copy while the production image provider is being evaluated. Results are provided without a guarantee that every visible mark can be removed.</p><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not upload illegal material, malicious files, or content that violates another person’s privacy. Automated abuse, attempts to access other users’ objects, and interference with the service are prohibited.</p></article>
</SiteLayout>
